<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Dah Bang shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Dah Bang shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of printing machinery distributor Dah Bang (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The shares ended HK$0.08 up at HK$1.23 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dah Bang had said earlier that it was considering certain asset purchases or may conduct a fund raising exercise.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
